    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Yumna Siddiqi remembers the look of concern on her mother's face when she told her about her decision to volunteer at the COVID Field Isolation Centre set up by the Sindh government in Karachi. Located at Expo Centre, the facility plans to house people who are either homeless, lack the financial means to access hospital care, or who are unable to safely isolate themselves from family members at their homes.",
